  "html": "\n\n\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"block\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4>橄榄树社区义诊-爱从用心开始</h4>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4>报名服务有线上和线下两种方式.&nbsp; 义诊现场免费服务的项目包括但不限于：流感疫苗注射，新冠疫苗注射，体检，血检等服务。我们义诊的地点和时间分别是:</h4><h4>10月 11日 RTP 罗利三角园区<br>10月25日 Charlotte 夏洛特<br>11月2 日 Greenville 格林維爾<br>11月 8日 Greensboro 绿堡</h4>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/cn/freeclinicregister/\">Registration 报名吧！</a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"block\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/cn/freeclinicregister/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2025/08/30af83121d2c9fcb110f11035e8d7153-scaled.jpg\" title=\"30af83121d2c9fcb110f11035e8d7153\" alt=\"30af83121d2c9fcb110f11035e8d7153\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"row cols-3\"><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<figure><a href=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/cn/freeclinicregister/\"><img width=\"640\" height=\"542\" src=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2022/09/calendar-159098_640.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></figure><h4><a href=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/cn/freeclinicregister/\">义诊日期：</a></h4><p><span>11月 8日 Greensboro 绿堡<br>\n10月25日 Charlotte 夏洛特<br>\n10月 11日 RTP 罗利三角园区<br>\n </span></p>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<figure><a href=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/cn/freeclinicregister/\"><img width=\"637\" height=\"640\" src=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2022/09/icons-1831922_640.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></figure><h4><a href=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/cn/freeclinicregister/\">义诊咨询电话</a></